# This project resolves everything from npmjs.org.
#
# The machine-level ~/.npmrc points `registry` at Flock's CodeArtifact mirror, whose token expires and
# needs an `aws login` in a browser to refresh. Coke needs that mirror; this app does not. It used to
# need a GitHub Packages token as well, for Flock's component library -- that went when the interface
# moved to shadcn/ui and Radix, so a fresh clone now installs with no Flock credentials at all.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
